CREATED:20230627T091726Z
DESCRIPTION:Topic\n:\nEntrepreneurship & Resilience\nSynopsis\n:\nCome hear
	 Dorothea’s journey into entrepreneurship\, the challenges she encounter
	ed\, how she stayed resilient and overcame them. \n- Learn how we can chan
	nel entrepreneurial traits as ‘intrapreneurs’ - challenge the status q
	uo\, navigated the unknowns\, be creative\, and break out of self-imposed 
	mental confines.\n- How to be entrepreneurial in our daily work – naviga
	ting complex environments and identifying opportunities amongst rapid chan
	ge.\nSpeaker\n:\nDorothea Koh\, Founder & CEO of BotMD\nZhi Wei LOH (Head\
	, Marketing & Communications) \nJoining Instructions\n(In-Person)\n:\nDBS 
	Asia East/Asia West Auditorium (#03-00 Marina Bay Financial Centre Tower 3
	\, Singapore  018983\, Singapore)\nJoining Instructions\n(via Webex)\n \nJ
	oin via Laptop\n*As a first time participant using DBS laptop\, you must f
	ollow this  One Time Webex Setup using DBS Laptop.mp4 <https://dbs1bank-my
	.sharepoint.com/:v:/g/personal/jamesongck_dbs_com/EVcKkn_W6DlCq6ZBNJZMd10B
	d_0ordpIVCHSxT1Ucjyl6g?e=SzBDh2>  guide prior to the event. This will inst
	all Webex Meeting App from DBS Software Centre for optimal streaming exper
	ience!\n1.	On the day of the event\, click on this hyperlink: Webex Events
	 URL <https://dbs.webex.com/dbs/onstage/g.php?MTID=e3cf8eeba38e206605d89de
	4272e0e8da> \n2.	Enter your First Name\, Last Name\, Email Address and cli
	ck on [Join Now]\n \n \nJoin via Mobile Device\n1.	Download Webex Meetings
	 App from Apple App Store or Google PlayStore\nClick on Join Meeting & Inp
	ut Meeting Number: 2514 051 6829\n2.	Input Password 1234\n \n \nJoin via P
	hone (audio only)\nDial:  +65-3157-6442 (Singapore)\nDial:  +852-3018-6828
	 (Hong Kong)\nDial:  +91-22-6480-0114 (India-Mumbai)\nDial:  +91-40-6480-0
	114 (India-Hyderabad)\nMeeting Number:  2514 051 6829\nGlobal call-in numb
	ers <https://dbs.webex.com/dbs/globalcallin.php?MTID=e676867362e0173666ba5
	856cc26881d5> \n \n \n \n \n
DTEND;TZID="Singapore Standard Time":20230719T115000
